[18:08:32] [backend] Experience using Spring, Maven and Angular frameworks, HTML, CSS.
[18:08:32] [backend] Knowledge with other contemporary Java technologies (e.g. Weblogic, RabbitMQ, Tomcat, etc.).
[18:08:32] [backend] Knowledge of JSP, J2EE, and JDBC.
