[21:01:40] [backend]     "answer": "For unit tests, I isolate the Spring service with JUnit and Mockito, mock repository or external dependencies, and validate both success and failure paths. For integration tests, I load the Spring context with Spring Test, hit real wiring between layers, and verify database-facing behavior through test configurations. I keep these tests in CI so regressions are caught before deployment, which supported my Jenkins-based delivery workflow."
[21:01:40] [backend]   },
