[18:20:51] [backend] Ardent's IVF clinics, search network with geo-radius targeting around each clinic location. Ad group level: organized by
[18:20:51] [backend] intent signal, not product category. "IVF clinic near me" vs "IVF success rates" vs "IVF cost" represent completely
[18:20:51] [backend] different
