[18:20:51] [backend] below 20% and referrals above 50%, she's right.
[18:20:51] [backend] Data showed referrals at 35% vs paid at 28%. She was partially right. But referrals produced 2.8 patients/month while paid
[18:20:51] [backend] produced 14.8. We needed both. I asked what would improve paid leads. She said: "If they knew pricing upfront." I added
[18:20:51] [backend] 
[18:20:51] [backend] pricing to the landing page — volume dropped 15% but conversion rate jumped from 28% to 38%.
