[18:20:51] [backend] — what keywords competitors are bidding on, estimated spend levels, which ads have been running longest (longevity
[18:20:51] [backend] signals effectiveness). At Ardent, noticing competitors ignored "egg freezing consultation" — lower competition, high
[18:20:51] [backend] intent
[18:20:51] [backend] — opened an untapped traffic source that produced consultations at 30% lower CPA than core IVF keywords.
