[18:20:51] [backend] we're converting at 2% and the category average is 5-7%, there's a genuine 2-3x improvement available through CRO alone
[18:20:51] [backend] — without spending more. This is the highest-leverage lever if the gap exists. Audience expansion second: if current
[18:20:51] [backend] targeting is narrow and fully saturated, lookalike expansion from quality converters can unlock volume at comparable CPL.
[18:20:51] [backend] Creative refresh third: if we've been running the same creative for 6-plus months, frequency fatigue is artificially inflating
[18:20:51] [backend] CPL. A significant refresh has historically produced 20-40% CPL improvement in mature accounts.
[18:20:51] [backend] If none of those paths credibly reach 3x: I'd say exactly that. "We can improve meaningfully — I'd estimate 40-60% CPL
[18:20:51] [backend] reduction is achievable within 90 days through these three levers. Getting to 3x would require either additional budget, a
