[18:20:51] [backend] 3x improvement on a well-optimized account is a budget conversation or a quality conversation. I'd rather have that
[18:20:51] [backend] conversation now than face it during a quarterly review.
[18:20:51] [backend] Q116. The product you're marketing has bad reviews online. How does that affect your strategy?
[18:20:51] [backend] COACH: Show strategic thinking. Show willingness to have the hard conversation.
