[18:20:51] [backend] 10,000
[18:20:51] [backend] surveys found the exact segment that needed what we offered. The result was 125% ROI vs a competitor losing $5 per
[18:20:51] [backend] acquisition. Targeting the right audience honestly beats targeting broadly with a compromised product every time.
