[18:33:01] [backend] Q113. Meta restricts healthcare targeting for your IVF clinic. Their main channel goes dark. What do
[18:33:01] [backend] you do?
[18:33:01] [backend] COACH: Diagnose restriction type first. Show contingency channels.
