[18:33:01] [backend] — without spending more. This is the highest-leverage lever if the gap exists. Audience expansion second: if current
[18:33:01] [backend] targeting is narrow and fully saturated, lookalike expansion from quality converters can unlock volume at comparable CPL.
[18:33:01] [backend] Creative refresh third: if we've been running the same creative for 6-plus months, frequency fatigue is artificially inflating
[18:33:01] [backend] CPL. A significant refresh has historically produced 20-40% CPL improvement in mature accounts.
