[18:33:01] [backend] prevents premature panic and the reactive changes that follow it.
[18:33:01] [backend] Weeks four through eight: early optimization. I can show directional improvements — CPL stabilizing, quality signal
[18:33:01] [backend] emerging, conversion path clarifying. I present leading indicators, not business outcomes, and I name that distinction
[18:33:01] [backend] explicitly.
