[18:33:01] [backend] the
[18:33:01] [backend] target in writing from day one is what made hitting it meaningful.
[18:33:01] [backend] What I ask from stakeholders — and I name this explicitly: conversion tracking access, CRM integration for lead quality
[18:33:01] [backend] feedback, and 30-minute weekly check-ins. Unclear expectations about inputs, not just outputs, are the root of most
