[18:54:05] [backend] once quality signal existed. Using the wrong objective burns budget on the wrong optimization signal.
[18:54:05] [backend] Four: build the qualification layer. High-ticket services cannot afford to send unqualified leads to the sales team. This
[18:54:05] [backend] multistep intent filtering is directly what drove the 40% booking rate improvement at Ardent. Industry standard booking
[18:54:05] [backend] rates in
[18:54:05] [backend] this space are 10-15%. We ran significantly above that.
[18:54:05] [backend] Five: instrument everything before launch. Conversion tracking, UTM parameters, Tableau dashboard live before spending.
