[18:54:05] [backend] four:
[18:54:05] [backend] industry benchmarks — how does current performance compare to vertical averages? At Marketing Dollar, knowing
[18:54:05] [backend] industry
[18:54:05] [backend] average IVF ROAS was 5-8x while we were at 28x-32x told me we had significant headroom before hitting competitive
