[18:54:05] [backend] advertisers
[18:54:05] [backend] don't have, and it's directly why we could hit the business metric that actually mattered: cost per closed consultation.
[18:54:05] [backend] Four levels of conversion tracking. Level one — engagement signals: time on site above 2 minutes, specific high-intent
[18:54:05] [backend] page
