[18:54:05] [backend] target for both Google and Meta bidding strategies. Level four — business outcomes: booked consultations, appointments
[18:54:05] [backend] kept, closed deals. These live in Salesforce CRM and connect back to campaign data via UTM parameters — producing
[18:54:05] [backend] true
[18:54:05] [backend] revenue ROAS, not just lead-based ROAS.
