[18:54:05] [backend] it
[18:54:05] [backend] with GA4 campaign performance data on the UTM identifier, and produce a single table showing: campaign → clicks →
[18:54:05] [backend] leads → qualified actions → closed revenue → true ROAS. One source of truth, not three competing dashboards.
