[18:54:05] [backend] produced 14.8. We needed both. I asked what would improve paid leads. She said: "If they knew pricing upfront." I added
[18:54:05] [backend] 
[18:54:05] [backend] pricing to the landing page — volume dropped 15% but conversion rate jumped from 28% to 38%.
