[18:54:05] [backend] that gives leadership visibility? Did I develop the team's capabilities? Did I identify a channel or audience that the company
[18:54:05] [backend] wasn't using before and prove it out? At Stars Wellness, incremental channels I tested added 30% to total acquisition
[18:54:05] [backend] volume
[18:54:05] [backend] in year one.
