[18:54:05] [backend] Insights shows impression share, overlap rate, and position — tells me exactly how aggressively competitors are bidding
[18:54:05] [backend] and
[18:54:05] [backend] where they're winning against me. At Marketing Dollar, watching competitor creative over 6 months revealed they were
