[18:54:05] [backend] viewed IVF-specific pages — highest-intent people I already have. Lookalike audiences from existing lead lists. Interest
[18:54:05] [backend] targeting in adjacent categories — parenting planning, reproductive health adjacent topics — that aren't restricted. Less
