[19:11:23] [backend] Q1. Tell me about yourself — 90 seconds, why are you the Growth Marketing Lead we should hire?
[19:11:23] [backend] COACH: Lead with a credibility anchor number. Benchmark it. Close with explicit value for this company.
[19:11:23] [backend] Leave them thinking: "This person has already solved the problem were hiring for."
[19:11:23] [backend] I'm a performance marketing professional with 5-plus years of paid media experience — and a documented track record of
[19:11:23] [backend] building the measurement and qualification infrastructure that makes campaigns actually scale.
[19:11:23] [backend] At Ardent Technologies in Chicago, I managed Google and Meta Ads for US IVF clinics. Within three months: 35% more
[19:11:23] [backend] patient consultations, 28% lower cost per consultation, 40% higher booking rates. Those results didn't come from tweaking
[19:11:23] [backend] bids — they came from diagnosing that the problem was funnel architecture, not ad performance, and rebuilding the
[19:11:23] [backend] qualification layer before touching a single campaign setting.
[19:11:23] [backend] Before Ardent, I ran Facebook campaigns at 28x-32x ROAS — six to eight times the industry benchmark of 3x-5x —
[19:11:23] [backend] generating $336K to $384K monthly from $12K in spend. That's not a lucky campaign. That's a repeatable system.
[19:11:23] [backend] I'm completing my MS in Marketing Analytics at ISU with a 3.92 GPA, hold 14 certifications, and I build my own Tableau
