[19:11:23] [backend] creative testing contributed to the 35% consultation improvement.
[19:11:23] [backend] One variable at a time — always. I've seen campaigns test headline, visual, and CTA simultaneously and conclude nothing
[19:11:23] [backend] because there's no way to isolate cause and effect. Variable isolation is the discipline that makes testing compound into
[19:11:23] [backend] institutional knowledge rather than one-off data points.
