[19:11:23] [backend] significantly.
[19:11:23] [backend] Short tests overweight whatever happened to perform well on a Tuesday. Statistical confidence threshold: 85% minimum
[19:11:23] [backend] before calling a winner. A 20% CTR lift on 40 clicks is not a finding.
