[19:11:23] [backend] page
[19:11:23] [backend] views (process pages, pricing pages), video completions above 50%. Too soft to optimize against directly, but valuable as
[19:11:23] [backend] retargeting audience signals. Level two — intent signals: lead form opens, partial form completions, click-to-call events. I
