[19:11:23] [backend] conversions are sparse. Without these, the algorithm has nothing to learn from for the first 4-6 weeks.
[19:11:23] [backend] 
[19:11:23] [backend] Level three — qualified actions: completed form submissions, consultation request confirmations. Primary optimization
[19:11:23] [backend] target for both Google and Meta bidding strategies. Level four — business outcomes: booked consultations, appointments
