[19:11:23] [backend] review hypotheses, not just results — because I want to build people who think before they act, not just people who execute
[19:11:23] [backend] quickly.
[19:11:23] [backend] The institutional knowledge discipline I'd build from day one: every test documented, every campaign decision logged with
[19:11:23] [backend] its hypothesis, every learning accessible to the team. That compounds into a durable competitive advantage and survives
[19:11:23] [backend] team turnover.
