[19:11:23] [backend] Q112. You inherit a $100K/month underperforming paid media account. First 30 days.
[19:11:23] [backend] COACH: Restraint in week one is itself a signal of seniority.
[19:11:23] [backend] Leave them thinking: "This person would not blow up our account trying to prove themselves in week one."
