[19:11:23] [backend] programmatic, CTV alongside core Google and Meta. Identify top 3 winners in 90 days.
[19:11:23] [backend] Phase two, months 4-6: hyper-personalization. Instead of one campaign, create segmented campaigns for different user
[19:11:23] [backend] profiles with tailored messaging.
[19:11:23] [backend] Phase three, months 7-9: content and brand investment. Owned channels — video series, podcasts, SEO content — that
[19:11:23] [backend] compound over time.
[19:11:23] [backend] Phase four, months 10-12: advanced data infrastructure. Attribution platforms, customer data warehouses, predictive
[19:11:23] [backend] analytics.
[19:11:23] [backend] Even with unlimited budget I would NOT spray across channels without testing, chase vanity metrics, or abandon
[19:11:23] [backend] performance marketing. Budget increase doesn't change discipline. It accelerates learning.
