[19:14:34] [backend] Ardent's IVF clinics, search network with geo-radius targeting around each clinic location. Ad group level: organized by
[19:14:34] [backend] intent signal, not product category. "IVF clinic near me" vs "IVF success rates" vs "IVF cost" represent completely
[19:14:34] [backend] different
[19:14:34] [backend] buying stages — each needs distinct ad copy and landing pages. Ad level: 3-4 responsive search ads per group testing
[19:14:34] [backend] different value props. Landing pages: 1:1 message match — if the ad says "Free Consultation," the landing page headline
[19:14:34] [backend] says "Free Consultation." Measurement: conversion tracking live before a dollar is spent.
