[19:14:34] [backend] At Marketing Dollar, I scaled from $400/day to $1,200/day over 6 weeks while maintaining 28x-32x ROAS — six to eight
[19:14:34] [backend] times the industry benchmark of 3x-5x. The mechanism was the 20% rule: never increase budget more than 20% per week.
