[19:14:34] [backend] offunnel engagement in my campaigns. The visual second — static vs video, clinical vs lifestyle. The offer framing third —
[19:14:34] [backend] same offer, different language, meaningfully different conversion rates. The CTA fourth — lower impact than the first three
[19:14:34] [backend] but worth testing once top variables are locked.
