[19:14:34] [backend] emerging, conversion path clarifying. I present leading indicators, not business outcomes, and I name that distinction
[19:14:34] [backend] explicitly.
[19:14:34] [backend] Month three onwards: I expect to show clear ROAS improvement, CPL reduction, and volume progress. At Ardent, the
[19:14:34] [backend] 28%
[19:14:34] [backend] cost reduction happened within three months — I set that as the benchmark in the initial onboarding conversation. Having
[19:14:34] [backend] the
