[20:00:53] [backend] conversions are sparse. Without these, the algorithm has nothing to learn from for the first 4-6 weeks.
[20:00:53] [backend] 
[20:00:53] [backend] Level three — qualified actions: completed form submissions, consultation request confirmations. Primary optimization
[20:00:53] [backend] target for both Google and Meta bidding strategies. Level four — business outcomes: booked consultations, appointments
[20:00:53] [backend] kept, closed deals. These live in Salesforce CRM and connect back to campaign data via UTM parameters — producing
[20:00:53] [backend] true
[20:00:53] [backend] revenue ROAS, not just lead-based ROAS.
