[20:03:26] [backend] M.A.S.S., this framework produced the messaging insights behind the 60% YoY event participation growth. At Ardent,
[20:03:26] [backend] creative testing contributed to the 35% consultation improvement.
[20:03:26] [backend] One variable at a time — always. I've seen campaigns test headline, visual, and CTA simultaneously and conclude nothing
