[20:03:26] [backend] acquisition
[20:03:26] [backend] cost (true CAC including all marketing costs) vs LTV. If LTV/CAC is above 4x, the acquisition engine is healthy and
[20:03:26] [backend] scalable. If it's below 3x, I'm in efficiency mode.
