[20:03:26] [backend] Q116. The product you're marketing has bad reviews online. How does that affect your strategy?
[20:03:26] [backend] COACH: Show strategic thinking. Show willingness to have the hard conversation.
[20:03:26] [backend] Leave them thinking: "This person would tell us the truth about a product problem instead of spending into it."
