[20:03:26] [backend] targeting to the specific use case where reviews are positive." That's a hard conversation. It's also the most important one —
[20:03:26] [backend] and avoiding it is how performance marketers destroy trust by delivering short-term traffic against a long-term brand
[20:03:26] [backend] problem.
