[20:03:26] [backend] Phase three, months 7-9: content and brand investment. Owned channels — video series, podcasts, SEO content — that
[20:03:26] [backend] compound over time.
[20:03:26] [backend] Phase four, months 10-12: advanced data infrastructure. Attribution platforms, customer data warehouses, predictive
[20:03:26] [backend] analytics.
