[20:35:53] [backend] creative testing contributed to the 35% consultation improvement.
[20:35:53] [backend] One variable at a time — always. I've seen campaigns test headline, visual, and CTA simultaneously and conclude nothing
[20:35:53] [backend] because there's no way to isolate cause and effect. Variable isolation is the discipline that makes testing compound into
[20:35:53] [backend] institutional knowledge rather than one-off data points.
[20:35:53] [backend] Minimum 14-day run time — not 7 days. In healthcare especially, weekday and weekend intent behavior differs
[20:35:53] [backend] significantly.
[20:35:53] [backend] Short tests overweight whatever happened to perform well on a Tuesday. Statistical confidence threshold: 85% minimum
[20:35:53] [backend] before calling a winner. A 20% CTR lift on 40 clicks is not a finding.
