[20:38:26] [backend] Attribution across Google and Meta is where most paid media managers make expensive mistakes — and where I've built a
[20:38:26] [backend] distinct advantage.
[20:38:26] [backend] The core problem: both platforms claim credit for the same conversion. Meta reports view-through conversions; Google
[20:38:26] [backend] reports last-click. Add up their reported ROAS figures and you'll almost always get a higher total than your actual revenue.
