[20:38:26] [backend] don't have. The result was decisions made on cost-per-closed-consultation, not cost-per-lead. That's a fundamentally
[20:38:26] [backend] different
[20:38:26] [backend] optimization target — and it's why we hit the business metric that actually mattered. I'd build this stack here within the first
