[20:38:26] [backend] not trial users. Retargeting of website visitors and trial users who haven't converted, with distinct creative for each
[20:38:26] [backend] audience's
[20:38:26] [backend] specific friction point. $5K to YouTube pre-roll — 10%. Subscription products benefit from demonstration. A 30-second
[20:38:26] [backend] "product in use" video builds consideration that Search then captures. $2K held for new channel testing — 4%. One
[20:38:26] [backend] structured test per quarter.
