[20:38:26] [backend] before
[20:38:26] [backend] a dollar is spent. Weeks four through eight — learning phase, minimum budgets for smart bidding signal accumulation.
[20:38:26] [backend] Month three — full optimization, lookalike expansion from paying subscriber base, first channel test.
