[20:38:26] [backend] data is the truth. I'd never be locked into the initial allocation if the first 90 days prove it wrong.
[20:38:26] [backend] Q115. Boss says: 3x more leads next quarter, same budget. How do you respond?
[20:38:26] [backend] COACH: Honest before strategic. Show the audit framework for finding real improvement.
