[20:38:26] [backend] I
[20:38:26] [backend] want to make sure we're aligned on what's realistic before I commit to a number." That's not pushback — that's protecting
[20:38:26] [backend] the
[20:38:26] [backend] business from a target set on aspiration rather than evidence.
