[20:38:26] [backend] accelerating churn.
[20:38:26] [backend] 
[20:38:26] [backend] First: I diagnose the nature and distribution of the reviews. Are they about a specific resolved issue, or an ongoing product
[20:38:26] [backend] failure? Are they concentrated in a specific use case or customer segment? That distinction determines what's fixable with
[20:38:26] [backend] marketing and what requires product work first.
